{"results":[{"url":"https://www.breitbart.com/tag/hunter-biden/","final_url":"https://www.breitbart.com/tag/hunter-biden/","title":"Hunter Biden Articles - Breitbart","description":"Hunter Biden -","language":"en","text":"## Two Ex-FBI Agents Charged with Lying to Congress About Hunter Biden Investigations: ‘The Hammer of Justice’\n\nTwo former Federal Bureau of Investigation (FBI) officials have been charged with lying to Congress about investigations into former President Joe Biden’s (D) son, Hunter Biden, the U.S. Attorney’s Office for the District of Columbia announced Friday.","author":"Amy Furr","published_date":"2026-10-23T21:05:53Z","latency_ms":1753.8008079991414,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}